    {
      "path": "src/modules/market-data/market-data.ts",
      "content": "A malformed asOf string (for example, 'not-a-date' or a timestamp without an offset) causes latestCompleted's Temporal.Instant.from call to throw. This makes query reject its promise instead of returning the structured Rejected result used for invalid date contexts. Validate the instant or catch its parsing error and return an issue on asOf before invoking the policy; add coverage for malformed timestamps.",
